1
00:00:00,470 --> 00:00:03,200
...and she's only 4 feet tall.

2
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:11,340
(Howard:)So, what do we do now?
They expect us to go away for the weekend.

3
00:00:17,287 --> 00:00:20,887
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)There's an Indian casino near Palm Springs.

4
00:00:22,392 --> 00:00:24,362
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)You know how to shoot craps?

5
00:00:24,561 --> 00:00:27,031
(Howard:)No, but I'm not a stranger to dice games.

6
00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:30,500
(Howard:)I was the Temple Beth-El Hebrew School
Yahtzee champion.

7
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:38,060
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)I'll teach you how to play.

8
00:00:39,276 --> 00:00:41,076
(Howard:)Really?

9
00:00:41,878 --> 00:00:43,208
(Howard:)Thank you, sir.

10
00:00:45,115 --> 00:00:46,585
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)Call me Mike.

11
00:00:48,919 --> 00:00:50,319
(Howard:)Okay.

12
00:00:53,623 --> 00:00:57,563
(Howard:)Boy, we're just married to
a couple of ball-busters, huh, Mike?

13
00:00:59,095 --> 00:01:04,025
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)That's my wife and daughter
you're talking about.

